WEBVTT

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:03.810
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.210
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.190
Isn't Ikuto's new Character Transformation totally awesome?

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:12.530
Amu-chan's new Character Transformation is lovely as well!

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.120
Whoa! It's a huge X Character!

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.390
And the true identity of the Boss will finally be revealed!

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:19.690
It's one revelation after another, from start to finish!

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:22.440
Better keep those eyes peeled to the screen!

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:23.770
Doki!

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:42.180
If you were to walk so the wind fluttered the edge of your cape,

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:48.570
people would look up at you in quiet admiration.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:55.870
You can say spicy things like "it's not my style," if you want,

00:00:55.870 --> 00:01:02.290
but I know who you really are because I'm your friend!

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.160
Stand! Bow!

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.690
Nice and orderly now!

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:09.530
And once that's done,

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:14.800
it's time to start the school day.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:22.420
I like Mondays because I can see all my friends.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:28.820
There's nothing wrong with being abnormally happy.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:35.990
At lunch break, we have tea in the Royal Garden,

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:43.330
where I tell you all my secrets!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.270
Episode 101
The Torn Picture Book! The Tragic Secret!

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:06.310
Ikuto...

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:11.770
You want me to embrace all your pain and suffering.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.790
If you really have to fight, it's the least I can do.

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:33.490
Character Transformation: Amulet Fortune!

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.710
Character Transformation: Seven Seas Treasure!

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:47.020
W-What?

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.840
What happened?

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:50.420
Amu-chan!

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:52.030
Ran!

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:53.100
I'm here, too!

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.980
As am I!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.900
Why are you all...

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.330
Everyone's together!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:02.470
Yay!

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.730
All of you are inside of me?

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:08.540
So this is a four-way Character Transformation?

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.600
Bingo!

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:16.680
I...

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.530
What is this?

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:23.260
Ikuto! You're finally your old self again-nya!

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.260
Hooray, he's back! My Ikuto's back!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:31.620
So I Character Transformed into this form with you?

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:37.990
There's another egg besides Yoru's...

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:43.320
This feeling... I remember it from long ago...

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:49.090
New Character Transformations...

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.580
Amu-chan!

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:54.750
Tadase-kun!

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.330
Tadase...

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.760
What are you doing, Ikuto?

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.560
What's wrong with you? Fight!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:16.150
Damn it...

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.100
Useless piece of junk!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.550
What is going on here?

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:31.160
Amu-chan, you can't maintain this form for very long.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.540
You must hurry!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.160
Right!

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.380
They formed a giant X Egg?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.770
What <i>is</i> that?

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:04.670
With this turn of events...

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:05.940
It might...

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:07.160
There's a chance...

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.790
And there it is!

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.050
An X Character?

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.710
These emotions...

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.190
They're so...

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:48.570
Amu-chan!

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.700
Emerald Line!

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.430
And you unharmed, my princess?

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:08.150
Hey, what're you scooping me up like this for?

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:10.930
What? I don't even get a "thank you?"

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.300
Because that's my line!

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:16.160
I brought you back to your senses, you know!

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.310
I know.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.440
And that's why...

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.480
This time, I'll be the one to protect you.

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:37.230
Ikuto-niisan, that giant X Character is made from many X Eggs.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.670
We'll have to slice it apart and immobilize it first!

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:50.340
It seems the two of us feel the same way.

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.270
Emerald Line!

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:01.070
Holy Saber!

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:21.610
Yes, good, purify those X Eggs, Hinamori Amu.

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:22.880
And when you do...

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:29.230
So many X Eggs...

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:32.010
So many hearts' eggs...

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.700
All of their dreams...

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.600
...of what they want to be.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:38.770
Guys, I'll get rid of those X's right now!

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.270
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:45.960
Open Heart!

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:28.610
Hey, could that egg be...

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:31.860
Over there!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.580
The Embryo!

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:39.940
It's here!

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:42.540
You better catch it this time, you bums!

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.140
R-Right!

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.900
Activate the Embryo Catcher!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:46.500
Yessir!

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:50.460
Fire!

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.570
We did it...

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:02.100
We did it!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.960
We finally did it!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.420
Chief!

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:06.520
But...

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:09.480
Should we really be happy about this?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.410
I finally caught it!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.260
So this is the Embryo?

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:24.000
I'll bring it to the Boss straight away!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.940
Director, you're-

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:29.590
X Eggs?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.040
What's going on?

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.680
They should all be purified-nya!

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:40.380
The sound of the violin died out.

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.680
But it's still having an effect!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:46.840
The X Eggs are appearing from all over town!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:00.120
White Wing!

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:07.120
Utau! Yaya!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.420
The little sisters are here to save the day!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.200
It's a big little ducky!

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:16.760
There's Rima and Nagi, too!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:23.060
Temari, conceal yourself for a spell.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.290
As you wish.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:26.170
Hey, guys!

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:28.270
Let us handle things here.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:30.650
Go after the Embryo, Amu!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.170
Ikuto, go with her.

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:37.160
Grab hold of our fate with your own hands.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.800
I won't look the other way ever again.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:45.130
I'll capture my freedom, myself!

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:48.540
Thanks for everything you've done, Utau.

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:56.920
The Director must be in the basement.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.270
There's a private elevator inside the tower.

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:02.510
Should you be telling them that?

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:04.400
Does it even matter anymore?

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:06.960
We've been abandoned by the Director!

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:09.820
Go! Hurry or you'll be too late!

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:11.190
Go, Amu-chan!

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:12.600
Yeah!

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:14.930
Okay!

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:24.870
The Boss... The mastermind behind Easter...

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:25.950
What's he like?

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.300
No idea.

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:29.540
I've never even heard his voice.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.960
The Boss doesn't show himself in front of anyone.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.330
Not even his own subordinates?

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:36.140
Nope.

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:39.890
And yet, no one would so much as think to disobey him.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:43.280
His control over them is that strong, I guess.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:47.930
The Boss is who ordered Easter to obtain the Embryo.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:51.890
We could be heading straight to him right now.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:57.890
I'm definitely going to get the Embryo back!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:34.710
Ah, you're here.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:38.710
But you're one step too late.

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:40.950
This is the Embryo.

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:42.300
Boss!

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:46.120
At last, it's mine.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:51.370
You're that boy...

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:53.790
But how?

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.770
I am Hikaru.

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:59.590
You refer to me as "the Boss." I am the President of Easter.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:02.610
That's...

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:05.220
But you're just a little boy.

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.550
I thought he was pretty mysterious, but...

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:10.010
Wait! Then whose voice was that before?

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:13.020
Mine. I simply used this device to alter it.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:14.850
A voice changer!

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:17.340
How do you like it, Boss?

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.760
It's a bit dinkier than I expected.

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:26.710
All it does is glow. I don't know if it's worth keeping.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:30.780
The Embryo...

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:34.620
...is losing its radiance!

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:48.450
Aw, man, it's not glowing anymore.

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:50.350
Bo-ring.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:59.900
Amu-chan!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:59.900
Amu!

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:20.630
Blaze Shoot!

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.310
More of them are gathering again!

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:31.100
There's no end to this!

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.430
Ikuto, Amu...

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:40.100
You guys get the Embryo.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:40.900
Right!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.950
Why did you do that, Hikaru-kun?

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.480
Isn't the Embryo what you wanted?

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:57.000
Crystals, jades, jewels...

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:01.500
This room is filled with precious stones.

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:07.960
With the inclusion of the Embryo, my collection should've been complete.

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:14.430
But it ended up being just a tiny, worthless stone.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:17.930
Jewels? A collection?

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.320
But that's...

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:28.750
You put X's on the hearts of so many kids for such a petty reason?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.880
I'm bored with this now.

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.780
B-Boss...

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:36.200
I have no need for worthless things.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:40.720
Director Hoshina, you are no longer of value to me either.

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:42.970
I'm done with you.

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:45.740
B-But...

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:49.830
I actually... got the Embryo... for you...

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:55.490
Like I said, the Embryo's just a tiny, worthless stone.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.750
That's not true.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:05.120
The Embryo is no mere jewel.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:10.180
It's a magic egg that can make your dreams come true.

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:12.940
It's the egg of people's dreams.

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:14.280
Tsukasa-san...

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:21.120
I'm here today to take back the page from that picture book.

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.500
Picture book?

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:31.010
Could he mean this?

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:37.160
You should remember the continuation of the story that was lost.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.400
I do not.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:42.050
Now, I'm sure you can recall it.

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:49.320
You lost your parents to an accident soon after you were born,

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:52.430
and you were taken in by your grandfather.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.700
Do not cry!

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:59.770
What can Tsukiyomi Aruto or his son do?

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:03.320
Play the violin? Make music? Preposterous.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:05.620
Child's play!

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:09.870
I, the one who has held Easter's reins for so long,

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:16.510
shall mold you, my grandson, into a suitable successor!

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:22.760
His grandfather is Director Hoshina?

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:28.810
To accomplish this, he married Hoshina Souko-san,

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:34.570
the past president's only daughter and Ikuto-kun and Utau-chan's mother.

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:42.040
Desperate to ensure the safety of her children, Souko-san couldn't refuse.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:51.960
Your grandfather was an exceedingly strict parent.

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:57.770
We will now begin your study of economics.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.850
Your next subject will be comparative government.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:08.110
Wait up!

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:09.750
Wait up!

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:15.870
You'll make it on time?

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:19.390
Yes. We'll find a way to speed things up somehow.

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:45.150
Collecting pretty stones?

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:50.790
Ah, right, your mother and father are no longer with you.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:53.150
That is not the correct phrase.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:56.060
To say my parents are "no longer with me."

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:56.990
They're dead.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.100
Aren't you lonely?

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:04.060
I stand at the very top of Easter.

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:09.040
As such, I study that which is necessary for me to govern it.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:12.590
To think of such things as loneliness would be a waste of time.

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:16.730
I must learn only that which has value to me.

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:18.440
Right...

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:19.170
But you know...

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:24.680
Even you have an egg inside your heart.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:31.440
Every child has an egg within their soul.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.960
This heart's egg cannot be seen with one's eyes.

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:45.280
This is...

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.250
This is nothing but a foolish dream!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.410
It's completely worthless!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:05.010
So Hikaru-kun ripped the page out...

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:08.020
What is it, Dia?

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:10.380
Is something happening to the Embryo?

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.740
Something's not right.

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:12.850
What do you mean?

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:15.810
So, you remembered?

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:19.290
I do not know anything about such a useless book.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:21.850
And I no longer have a page to return to you.

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:24.320
Wrong, you do have it.

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:26.200
But...

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:31.420
You won't do as you are now.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:33.460
Your heart is empty.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:40.730
What am I sensing?

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:42.720
I don't know, but...

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.180
I can feel it, too!

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:45.220
So can I!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.150
Yeah!

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:47.180
What's wrong?

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:50.690
The Embryo is sad.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:58.740
The X Eggs have stopped moving.

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:00.790
What's happening?

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:02.150
This is eerie.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:03.960
What the heck?

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:04.910
What is it?

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:07.870
A strong energy signal is coming from beneath the tower!

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:09.280
The Embryo?

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.970
No...

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:13.680
It's a waveform I've never seen before.

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:15.300
Everyone, look!

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:22.010
I have a bad feeling about this!

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:44.520
Could they be heading to where Hotori-kun and the others are?!

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:45.200
Amu!

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:46.320
Ikuto!

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.080
What...

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.680
Something's coming!

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:56.650
A huge power...

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:58.790
It's scary...

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:02.180
And yet, so very sad...

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:33.220
You sure do seem determined.

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:39.270
So even if you screw up, it'll somehow turn out all right.

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:46.640
How about you just trust in yourself?

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:53.100
Take that first step and everything will work out fine.

00:22:53.710 --> 00:23:00.030
Even if people see through your cool exterior, keep marching on.

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:09.110
Look up at the blue sky and everything will reset!

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:12.750
Take it easy! Take it easy!

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:23.290
Try to relax those shoulders and clear your mind.

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:30.000
The more you do it, the easier it'll get, so keep taking it easy.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:35.200
Ride the flow of time and you'll be...

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.000
Shining! Shining! Shining!

00:23:50.270 --> 00:23:53.420
Amu-chan, what's going to happen now?

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:56.180
The Embryo has lost its radiance...

00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:59.720
And a ton of X Eggs have accumulated...

00:23:59.720 --> 00:24:02.210
They've started to draw out everyone's sadness...

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:05.240
Don't worry, if we all work together...

00:24:05.240 --> 00:24:07.980
We can face it.

00:24:07.980 --> 00:24:10.140
We can fight it!

